् added to the last.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अतिच्छत्रकः", "अतिछत्रक"], "synonyms_slp1": ["aticCatrakaH", "atiCatraka"]}], "atijagati": [{"id": "atijagatI", "headword": "अतिजगती", "headword_slp1": "atijagatI", "fold": "atijagati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "अतिजगती f. (-ती) A form of metre, a stanza of four lines. with thirteen\nsyllables in each line.\n E. अति, and जगती another metre.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "atijava": [{"id": "atijava", "headword": "अतिजव", "headword_slp1": "atijava", "fold": "atijava", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "अतिजव mfn. (-वः-वा-वं) Marching fast or fleet.\n E. अति, and जव quick.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अतिजवः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["atijavaH"]}], "atijagara": [{"id": "atijAgara", "headword": "अतिजागर", "headword_slp1": "atijAgara", "fold": "atijagara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "अतिजागर mfn. (-रः-रा-रं) Very wakeful, restless.\n m. (-रः) The black\ncurlew.\n E. अति, and जागर wakeful.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अतिजागरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["atijAgaraH"]}], "atijirRa": [{"id": "atijIrRa", "headword": "अतिजीर्ण", "headword_slp1": "atijIrRa", "fold": "atijirRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "अतिजीर्ण mfn. (-र्ण-र्णा-र्णं) Very old.\n E. अति, and जीर्णं old.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "atiqina": [{"id": "atiqIna", "headword": "अतिडीन", "headword_slp1": "atiqIna", "fold": "atiqina", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "अतिडीन n. (-नं) Very lofty or very rapid flight of birds.\n E. अति, and\nडीन flying.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अतिडीनं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["atiqInaM"]}], "atitaram": [{"id": "atitarAm", "headword": "अतितराम्", "headword_slp1": "atitarAm", "fold": "atitaram", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": 